#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:10002
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速入门"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:10005
msgid ""
"This tutorial walks through the basic workflow for building a 3D galaxy "
"morphology model with Gal3D."
msgstr "本教程将带你了解使用 Gal3D 构建三维星系形态模型的基本流程。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:10007
msgid ""
"This page is generated from a Jupyter notebook, which you can download "
"using the link in the upper-right corner."
msgstr "本页面由 Jupyter notebook 生成，你可以通过右上角的链接下载该 notebook。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:20002
msgid "Extracting the Data"
msgstr "提取数据"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:20005
msgid ""
"We use the [AnastrisTNG](https://github.com/wx-ys/AnastrisTNG) library to"
" extract the positions (`pos`) and masses (`mass`) of stellar particles "
"for a galaxy in the TNG50-1 simulation."
msgstr ""
"我们使用 [AnastrisTNG](https://github.com/wx-ys/AnastrisTNG) 库，从 TNG50-1 模拟中的某个星系提取恒星粒子的"
"位置（`pos`）与质量（`mass`）。"


#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:20007
msgid "These data are used in the 3D modeling example below."
msgstr "这些数据将用于下方的三维建模示例。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:40003
msgid ""
"To demonstrate the Gal3D workflow, we use a galaxy extracted from "
"TNG50-1. To apply the same workflow to other data sets, simply replace "
"the particle positions (`pos`) and masses (`mass`). Here, `pos` should "
"have shape `(N, 3)`, and `mass` should have shape `(N,)`."
msgstr ""
"为演示 Gal3D 的工作流程，我们使用从 TNG50-1 提取的一组星系数据。若要将同样流程应用到其他数据集，只需替换粒子位置（`pos`）"
"和质量（`mass`）。其中 `pos` 的形状应为 `(N, 3)`，`mass` 的形状应为 `(N,)`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:50002
msgid "Data Initialization"
msgstr "数据初始化"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:50007
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{py:meth}`Gal3DAnalyzer.analyze <gal3d.analyzer.Gal3DAnalyzer.analyze>` "
"automates several steps, including {ref}`particle initialization "
"<particle-initialization>`, {ref}`density-field construction <density-"
"field>`, {ref}`shape setup <shape-setting>`, and {ref}`optimizer "
"configuration <optimization>`. If you want finer control over each step, "
"see {ref}`Step-by-Step Workflow <step_by_step>`."
msgstr ""
"{py:meth}`Gal3DAnalyzer.analyze <gal3d.analyzer.Gal3DAnalyzer.analyze>` "
"会自动完成多个步骤，包括 {ref}`粒子初始化 <particle-initialization>`、"
"{ref}`密度场构建 <density-field>`、{ref}`形状设定 <shape-setting>` 以及 "
"{ref}`优化器配置 <optimization>`。如果你希望对每一步进行更细粒度控制，请参见 "
"{ref}`分步工作流程 <step_by_step>`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:50009
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Pass the particle positions (``pos``) and masses (``mass``) to the "
"{py:meth}`Gal3DAnalyzer.analyze <gal3d.analyzer.Gal3DAnalyzer.analyze>` "
"to initialize the 3D data."
msgstr ""
"将粒子位置（``pos``）和质量（``mass``）传入 "
"{py:meth}`Gal3DAnalyzer.analyze <gal3d.analyzer.Gal3DAnalyzer.analyze>`，"
"即可完成三维数据初始化。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:50011
msgid ""
"``recenter`` controls whether the particles are recentered before "
"analysis."
msgstr "``recenter`` 用于控制在分析前是否对粒子进行平移（重新中心化）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:50012
#, python-format
msgid ""
"``inner_frac`` sets the inner boundary at the radius where the density "
"falls to 90% of the central density."
msgstr "``inner_frac`` 将内边界设定在密度下降到中心密度 90% 对应的半径处。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:50013
msgid "``outer`` and ``outer_mode`` control how the outer boundary is defined."
msgstr "``outer`` 和 ``outer_mode`` 用于控制外边界的定义方式。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:70002
msgid "Fitting the Model"
msgstr "拟合模型"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:70005
msgid ""
"After initialization, the next step is to fit a model to the 3D galaxy "
"structure."
msgstr "完成初始化后，下一步是对三维星系结构进行模型拟合。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:70007
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"We use {py:meth}`Gal3DAnalyzer.fit <gal3d.analyzer.Gal3DAnalyzer.fit>` to"
" fit a set of nested ellipsoids to the particle distribution. Setting "
"`num_step=300` generates 300 nested ellipsoids. The default value is "
"`200`."
msgstr ""
"我们使用 {py:meth}`Gal3DAnalyzer.fit <gal3d.analyzer.Gal3DAnalyzer.fit>` "
"对粒子分布拟合一组嵌套椭球体。设置 `num_step=300` 会生成 300 个嵌套椭球，默认值为 `200`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:90002
msgid ""
"You may see a `PoorUniformityError` warning. This means that the sampling"
" points are not sufficiently uniform at certain radii, which may reduce "
"the accuracy of the fit. Those radii are therefore skipped."
msgstr ""
"你可能会看到 `PoorUniformityError` 警告。这表示在某些半径处采样点分布不够均匀，可能降低拟合精度，"
"因此这些半径会被跳过。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:100002
msgid "Fitting Results"
msgstr "拟合结果"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:100007
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For more information about the {py:class}`ModelResult "
"<gal3d.optimization.result.ModelResult>` class, see the {ref}`Fitting and"
" Optimization <optimization>` documentation."
msgstr ""
"关于 {py:class}`ModelResult <gal3d.optimization.result.ModelResult>` 类的更多信息，"
"请参见 {ref}`拟合与优化 <optimization>` 文档。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:100009
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"After fitting, ``res_ellipsoid_s`` contains the parameter values for all "
"nested ellipsoids. It is a {py:class}`ModelResult "
"<gal3d.optimization.result.ModelResult>` object that stores the fitted "
"model, model parameters, goodness-of-fit diagnostics, and related "
"quantities."
msgstr ""
"拟合完成后，``res_ellipsoid_s`` 包含所有嵌套椭球体的参数值。"
"它是一个 {py:class}`ModelResult <gal3d.optimization.result.ModelResult>` 对象，"
"用于保存拟合模型、模型参数、拟合优度诊断及相关量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:100013
msgid "Use ``res_ellipsoid_s.keys()`` to inspect the main parameter keys."
msgstr "可使用 ``res_ellipsoid_s.keys()`` 查看主要参数键。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:120003
msgid ""
"Use `res_ellipsoid_s.available_keys()` to view all available keys, "
"including both parameter keys and other related quantities."
msgstr ""
"可使用 `res_ellipsoid_s.available_keys()` 查看全部可用键，"
"包括参数键及其他相关量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:140002
msgid "You can also display `res_ellipsoid_s` directly as a table."
msgstr "你也可以将 `res_ellipsoid_s` 直接以表格形式显示。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:160002
msgid ""
"You can access the nth ellipsoid with `res_ellipsoid_s[n]` and inspect "
"its detailed properties."
msgstr ""
"你可以通过 `res_ellipsoid_s[n]` 访问第 n 个椭球，并查看其详细属性。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:170002
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\large\n"
"\\begin{array}{r c l}\n"
"& \\mathbf{Coordinate} & \\\\\n"
"\\text{Name} & : & \\large \\mathrm{ShiftEuler} \\\\\n"
"\\text{Func} & : & "
"\\mathbf{X}'=(\\mathbf{X}-\\mathbf{1}_n\\,\\mathbf{c})\\,R_{zyx}^{\\mathsf"
" T}(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma) \\\\\n"
"\\text{Param (6)} & : & x_c=-0.03,\\ y_c=0.04,\\ z_c=0.01,\\ "
"\\alpha=-1.11,\\ \\beta=-0.02,\\ \\gamma=-0.01 \\\\\n"
"\\text{Derived\\ param} & : & \\ "
"\\mathbf{c}=\\begin{bmatrix}x_c&y_c&z_c\\end{bmatrix},\\ \\ "
"R_{zyx}(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma)=R_{z}(\\alpha)\\,R_{y}(\\beta)\\,R_{x}(\\gamma)"
" \\\\\n"
"& \\mathbf{Geometry} & \\\\\n"
"\\text{Name} & : & \\large \\mathrm{SuperEllipsoid} \\\\\n"
"\\text{Func} & : & ([(\\frac{x}{a})^2]^{S_a} + [(\\frac{y}{b})^2]^{S_b} +"
" [(\\frac{z}{c})^2]^{S_c}) \\\\\n"
"\\text{Param (6)} & : & a=0.42,\\ \\epsilon_{ab}=0.40,\\ "
"\\epsilon_{bc}=0.57,\\ S_a=1.83,\\ S_b=1.74,\\ S_c=0.33 \\\\\n"
"\\text{Derived\\ param} & : & b = a(1 - \\epsilon_{ab})=0.25,\\ c = b(1 -"
" \\epsilon_{bc})=0.11 \\\\\n"
"& \\mathbf{Error} & \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{Err func}   & : & \\mathrm{sums\\_dev\\_rscale} \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{Err method} & : & \\mathrm{isodensity\\_curve\\_dcall} \\\\\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:180002
msgid "You can also examine how the shape parameters vary with radius."
msgstr "你还可以查看形状参数随半径变化的趋势。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:210002
msgid "Result Analysis"
msgstr "结果分析"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:210005
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"After obtaining the fitting results, you can analyze them using the "
"{py:class}`Characterizer "
"<gal3d.characterization.characterizer.Characterizer>` class."
msgstr ""
"得到拟合结果后，你可以使用 {py:class}`Characterizer "
"<gal3d.characterization.characterizer.Characterizer>` 类进行结果分析。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:210007
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Use {py:obj}`Characterizer.available_plugins "
"<gal3d.characterization.characterizer.Characterizer.available_plugins>` "
"to list all available characterization plugins. For example, the "
"{py:class}`Bar "
"<gal3d.characterization.characterizer_plugins.galaxy_bar.Bar>` plugin can"
" be used to measure the morphological properties of galactic bars."
msgstr ""
"使用 {py:obj}`Characterizer.available_plugins "
"<gal3d.characterization.characterizer.Characterizer.available_plugins>` "
"可列出所有可用的形态学分析插件。"
"例如，{py:class}`Bar <gal3d.characterization.characterizer_plugins.galaxy_bar.Bar>` "
"插件可用于测量星系棒结构的形态学性质。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:230002
msgid ""
"Use `Characterizer.get_plugin('Bar')` to obtain the Bar plugin and apply "
"it to the fitted result:"
msgstr ""
"使用 `Characterizer.get_plugin('Bar')` 获取 Bar 插件，并将其应用于拟合结果："

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:250002
msgid ""
"`flag=1` indicates that a bar is detected. `R_bar` gives the semi-major-"
"axis length of the bar."
msgstr ""
"`flag=1` 表示检测到棒结构。`R_bar` 给出棒结构的半长轴长度。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:260002
msgid "Visualization"
msgstr "可视化"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:260005
msgid ""
"Gal3D also provides visualization tools for direct comparison between the"
" model and the data."
msgstr "Gal3D 还提供可视化工具，用于直接比较模型与数据。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:260007
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The {py:class}`ModelProjector "
"<gal3d.visualization.model_projector.ModelProjector>` plugin projects the"
" 3D model onto a 2D plane, and {py:class}`ProjectorLineIntegration "
"<gal3d.visualization.model_projector_plugins.projector_line_integration.ProjectorLineIntegration>`"
" supports line-of-sight integrated projections."
msgstr ""
"{py:class}`ModelProjector <gal3d.visualization.model_projector.ModelProjector>` "
"插件可将三维模型投影到二维平面，"
"{py:class}`ProjectorLineIntegration "
"<gal3d.visualization.model_projector_plugins.projector_line_integration.ProjectorLineIntegration>` "
"支持沿视线积分的投影方式。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:260009
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The helper function {py:func}`show_image_model_residual "
"<gal3d.visualization.data_model_residual.show_image_model_residual>` "
"displays the projected data, the projected model, and their residuals "
"side by side for easy comparison."
msgstr ""
"辅助函数 {py:func}`show_image_model_residual "
"<gal3d.visualization.data_model_residual.show_image_model_residual>` "
"会并排显示投影后的数据、投影后的模型及其残差，便于直观比较。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/quick_start.ipynb:270005
